GoPay CDP Fetch pause fix
========================

Observed root cause:
- Browser-level Target.setAutoAttach(flatten=true) routed target events into per-session queues.
- Main loop read only the global queue.
- Fetch.requestPaused events were never delivered to HARRecorder.
- Responses remained paused and the browser page stayed loading until recorder shutdown.

Fix:
- BrowserConnection.recv_any() drains global lifecycle events and flattened target queues.
- Main loop forwards each session event to its TargetRecorder.
- Fetch response bodies are read and Fetch.continueRequest runs promptly.

Result:
- page target no longer stalls due to recorder event backlog
- current browser after stop: readyState=complete, pending resources=0
- incomplete HAR from the diagnostic run was deleted
